",\"children\":\"$5a:10:props:children:1:props:children:props:children\"}]}]]}]\n6e:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This pattern of pairing agent state with Neon snapshots creates a powerful architecture for building reliable, replayable AI agents. It addresses the core challenges of AI agent failure modes:\"}]\n6f:[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Recoverable state:\"}],\" Standard retry logic fails if an agent has already mutated state. Neon snapshots let you restore the database to the checkpointed state.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Stable connections:\"}],\" By using \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"target_branch_id\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"finalize_restore: True\"}],\" in the Neon API, the compute endpoint for your database moves to the restored state. Your application connection string does not have to change.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Auditable AI:\"}],\" By serializing the \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"RunState\"}],\" alongside database checkpoints, you maintain an audit log of what an agent saw, planned, and executed.\"]}],\"\\n\"]}]\n70:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"With this pattern, your AI agents are no longer black boxes making irreversible changes. They are fully versioned, durable, and easily debuggable systems. The recovery flow above shows the immediate case; the same idea also works for older runs that you need to replay without touching production.\"}]\n71:[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"replay-historical-runs-safely-with-branches\",\"className\":\"anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"Replay historical runs safely with branches\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-full px-2